  "cli_result_text": "Submitted. Key finding: `packages/react-scripts/config/webpack.config.js` (in `isEnvProductionProfile` branch) aliases `'scheduler/tracing': 'scheduler/tracing-profiling'`, but React 18.2.0's `scheduler` package (`packages/scheduler/package.json`) no longer ships `tracing.js`/`tracing-profiling.js` \u2014 the Interaction Tracing API was removed from React 18's scheduler entirely (files list is only `index.js`, `unstable_mock.js`, `unstable_post_task.js`). This CRA alias is dead/vestigial: it only fires under `react-scripts build --profile`, and only matters if some dependency still imports `scheduler/tracing`, which no longer resolves against this React version. The companion alias `'react-dom$': 'react-dom/profiling'` is still valid (`profiling.js` is declared in react-dom's `exports`/`files`), so it's the `scheduler/tracing` half specifically that's the dead reference.",
